Now, when we gaze upward on clear nights, we see Ayla's masterpiece. And sometimes, if you watch carefully, you'll notice a star flicker and dance. That's Ayla at her loom still, weaving new dreams into existence, reminding us that even in darkness, beauty can be born from longing and love.
